# Character sets: designating G0 to G3 (SCS), locking shifts (SO, SI, LS2, LS3), single shifts
# (SS2, SS3) and the DEC special graphics and UK sets.

test DEC special graphics draws a box
spec VT100 User Guide Table 3-9: j k l m q x are the corners and lines; xterm ctlseqs ESC ( 0
size 12 3
feed \e(0lqqk\r\nx  x\r\nmqqj\e(B
screen
|┌──┐|
|│  │|
|└──┘|

